   "role": "assistant",
   "text": "It is very unlikely to be faulty. The gurgling and bubbling sounds you hear are the refrigerant circulating through the pipes, which is completely normal. The clicking is typically the compressor starting or stopping its cycle, and the cracking noises at night are just the plastic interior panels expanding and contracting as temperatures change inside."
